      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bypass taxonomy — stated plainly, because a control that can be walked around must say so",
      "originalText": "Bypass taxonomy — stated plainly, because a control that can be walked around must say so",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_hz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 772,
      "width": 1376,
      "height": 151,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1513121870,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1839468653,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "bypass                          probability   impact   detectability              what actually holds\npersonal API key, own laptop    high          high     D  config attestation      device posture, and credential scoping\nprovider-native SDK, direct     high          medium   D  netflow and billing     egress policy on a managed network\nlocal model, no network at all  medium        medium   E  none                    nothing — say so, and size it\na different agent framework     medium        high     D  process inventory       registration required before credentials\nunregistered MCP over stdio     medium        high     B  client allowlist        enterprise policy replaces user config\ncurl inside an allowed shell    high          high     B  hook on shell.exec      the credential lease is the only backstop\nDoH, alternate DNS, IPv6        low           medium   E  none                    customer network controls, not ours",
      "originalText": "bypass                          probability   impact   detectability              what actually holds\npersonal API key, own laptop    high          high     D  config attestation      device posture, and credential scoping\nprovider-native SDK, direct     high          medium   D  netflow and billing     egress policy on a managed network\nlocal model, no network at all  medium        medium   E  none                    nothing — say so, and size it\na different agent framework     medium        high     D  process inventory       registration required before credentials\nunregistered MCP over stdio     medium        high     B  client allowlist        enterprise policy replaces user config\ncurl inside an allowed shell    high          high     B  hook on shell.exec      the credential lease is the only backstop\nDoH, alternate DNS, IPv6        low           medium   E  none                    customer network controls, not ours",
      "fontSize": 13,
